I'm afraid for you.

263
00:21:43.635 --> 00:21:44.469
listen

264
00:21:45.178 --> 00:21:46.763
I will talk to Lee Choo Woon…

265
00:21:46.847 --> 00:21:49.224
He won't do anything.

266
00:21:50.726 --> 00:21:51.852
What?

267
00:21:52.811 --> 00:21:55.939
He knows it's Gu Jun Mo,
but ordered to forget about it.

268
00:21:58.025 --> 00:22:01.903
It's just proof
how little Gi Seok meant to him.

269
00:22:23.175 --> 00:22:24.009
Devil.

270
00:22:24.593 --> 00:22:25.510
let me out

271
00:22:26.303 --> 00:22:27.554
Freaks

272
00:22:28.555 --> 00:22:29.973
Let me out!

273
00:22:32.184 --> 00:22:33.060
Ahoy!

274
00:22:35.145 --> 00:22:36.021
Ahoy!

275
00:22:36.730 --> 00:22:40.192
This is not a home, this is a prison! Freaks!

276
00:22:40.275 --> 00:22:41.568
Let me out!

277
00:22:41.651 --> 00:22:43.653
Let me out of here! Badge!

278
00:22:45.864 --> 00:22:48.450
Yes, I am going to Seoul.

279
00:22:49.951 --> 00:22:52.079
- Call in case of anything.
- Yes, sir.

280
00:23:01.171 --> 00:23:03.465
GU JUNG MO

281
00:23:07.094 --> 00:23:08.512
how are you bro

282
00:23:08.595 --> 00:23:11.556
<i>Hey, I have a job for you.</i>

283
00:23:12.599 --> 00:23:13.809
<i>Velychenka.</i>

284
00:23:18.480 --> 00:23:20.315
And to be damn clear,

285
00:23:21.525 --> 00:23:22.526
this time

286
00:23:23.902 --> 00:23:25.237
this is an order.

287
00:23:25.737 --> 00:23:27.614
<i>You have to do everything properly.</i>

288
00:23:30.450 --> 00:23:31.660
An order?

289
00:23:31.743 --> 00:23:33.829
Today. Call back about the place.

290
00:23:33.912 --> 00:23:34.955
How many are there?

291
00:23:36.331 --> 00:23:37.165
Only one.

292
00:23:37.249 --> 00:23:38.125
One?

293
00:23:43.880 --> 00:23:46.633
GU JUNG MO
DIRECTOR

294
00:23:46.716 --> 00:23:47.551
Mr. Gu.

295
00:23:47.634 --> 00:23:49.928
<i>So you say,</i>

296
00:23:50.429 --> 00:23:53.890
that the whole problem is
that Nam Gi Joon is still alive.

297
00:23:56.059 --> 00:23:57.727
So as soon as he dies…

298
00:23:59.771 --> 00:24:02.023
there will be no more problems.

299
00:24:04.317 --> 00:24:05.277
Sorry?

300
00:24:05.360 --> 00:24:06.403
<i>Nam Gi Joon.</i>

301
00:24:08.029 --> 00:24:09.531
I will take care of him.

302
00:24:11.032 --> 00:24:14.119
I rewatched Nam Gi Suk's case,
but something is wrong.

303
00:24:14.202 --> 00:24:16.413
{\an8}FOUND THE BODY
AND REPORTED BY HAN SOK YOUN

304
00:24:16.496 --> 00:24:18.582
"Found the body

305
00:24:19.749 --> 00:24:21.168
Han Seok Yoon."

306
00:24:21.877 --> 00:24:26.673
Investigating Officer - Han Seok Yoon,
but he also found the body.

307
00:24:28.300 --> 00:24:29.134
Find it.

308
00:24:31.303 --> 00:24:32.387
Bring it to me.

309
00:24:33.597 --> 00:24:35.182
And immediately.

310
00:24:35.682 --> 00:24:36.516
Yes, sir.

311
00:24:48.278 --> 00:24:49.362
friend

312
00:24:49.446 --> 00:24:52.532
You didn't get hurt yesterday, did you?

313
00:24:54.159 --> 00:24:55.577
We haven't seen each other for a long time.

314
00:24:55.660 --> 00:24:57.120
How are you, are you okay?

315
00:25:03.168 --> 00:25:04.419
Listen, it looks like

316
00:25:06.004 --> 00:25:07.714
Gu will not back down.

317
00:25:08.882 --> 00:25:11.092
It doesn't matter how good you are, okay?

318
00:25:12.052 --> 00:25:14.554
You are not against him, but against all of Bonsan.

319
00:25:15.096 --> 00:25:17.349
If you don't back down, it's very dangerous.

320
00:25:17.432 --> 00:25:20.810
To all of Bonsan - is that including you?

321
00:25:27.275 --> 00:25:29.110
Well, stop it.

322
00:25:33.448 --> 00:25:34.866
I remember how in the past

323
00:25:36.451 --> 00:25:38.078
when we did everything together...

324
00:25:40.497 --> 00:25:42.749
showdowns on the square were the crowning moment.

325
00:25:43.959 --> 00:25:45.418
At least then

326
00:25:45.502 --> 00:25:47.879
people were responsible for their actions.

327
00:25:49.756 --> 00:25:51.258
Why did you want to meet?

328
00:25:56.513 --> 00:25:57.764
Here, take it.

329
00:25:57.847 --> 00:25:59.432
Gu Jun Mo is hiding there.

330
00:26:01.935 --> 00:26:03.103
So what?

331
00:26:03.603 --> 00:26:07.607
I won't be able to run away forever.

332
00:26:08.108 --> 00:26:09.359
Don't worry about me.

333
00:26:09.943 --> 00:26:12.237
I was going to leave the company anyway.

334
00:26:17.742 --> 00:26:18.785
Aww, Gi Joon.

335
00:26:19.953 --> 00:26:21.246
go

336
00:26:22.163 --> 00:26:25.250
and finish what you have to, okay?

337
00:26:35.635 --> 00:26:37.554
{\an8}REPAIR
FLOORS 10-13 CLOSED

338
00:26:51.443 --> 00:26:52.569
Forgive me, my friend.

339
00:26:52.652 --> 00:26:54.613
<i>Meet Nam Gi Joon.</i>

340
00:26:55.113 --> 00:26:58.158
He then asks where I am.

341
00:26:58.783 --> 00:27:01.911
<i>When he asks,</i>
<i>act as if he tortured you,</i>

342
00:27:01.995 --> 00:27:03.830
<i>and lead him into my trap.</i>

343
00:27:05.206 --> 00:27:07.334
Your daughter just started walking, right?

344
00:27:07.417 --> 00:27:09.544
<i>Want to see her grow up?</i>

345
00:27:11.379 --> 00:27:13.298
<i>Well, Mr. Kim!</i>

346
00:27:14.132 --> 00:27:16.343
<i>Is Nam Gi Joon more important than family?</i>

347
00:27:17.010 --> 00:27:19.387
<i>If you want to save the life of the family,</i>

348
00:27:20.889 --> 00:27:22.849
he must be killed.

349
00:30:24.405 --> 00:30:25.615
OKUR

350
00:30:34.791 --> 00:30:36.334
Did you do the job?

351
00:30:41.714 --> 00:30:42.715
say

352
00:30:43.925 --> 00:30:46.052
<i>Is that scumbag dead?</i>

353
00:30:46.135 --> 00:30:47.178
hold on

354
00:30:48.054 --> 00:30:49.305
I will come for you.

355
00:30:57.438 --> 00:31:03.069
WITHOUT MERCY

356
00:31:04.654 --> 00:31:08.408
{\an8}11 YEARS AGO

357
00:31:43.902 --> 00:31:45.278
<i>Son of the leader...</i>

358
00:31:46.279 --> 00:31:47.989
Say you didn't kill him.

359
00:31:56.205 --> 00:31:57.707
Does it matter?

360
00:34:54.008 --> 00:34:59.013
Translation of subtitles: Olga Tsiatska

